00:17:13.925 --> 00:17:15.293
-[offscreen] Hey, I'm gonna
keep it real with you.

00:17:15.367 --> 00:17:17.076
-You watched him write 11!
-Oh.

00:17:17.076 --> 00:17:19.357
Yeah, you can't do--
-He did, just like this.

00:17:19.362 --> 00:17:21.062
-Well, my dad was 11 too,
so it was like--

00:17:21.062 --> 00:17:22.846
-He did not know it
until you wrote 11.

00:17:22.846 --> 00:17:23.946
-I didn't even see it.
-He got it wrong

00:17:23.946 --> 00:17:25.050
cuz I didn't wear a 2.

00:17:25.054 --> 00:17:26.775
-Hey, honest to God,
did you get 11 from him?

00:17:26.781 --> 00:17:28.039
-[laughs]
-I swear--

00:17:29.215 --> 00:17:30.215
-I have a feud.

